TITLE Native simulation reference
CHIP SIMLOOP MACH111
PIN 2 A
PIN 3 B
PIN 11 CLK
PIN 10 RST
PIN 18 Q REG
PIN 19 Y
EQUATIONS
Q=A
Q.CLKF=CLK
Q.RSTF=RST
Y=A*B
SIMULATION
TRACE_ON A B Q Y
SETF /A /B RST /CLK
SETF /RST
FOR I:=0 TO 2 DO BEGIN IF A THEN BEGIN SETF /A END ELSE BEGIN SETF A END CLOCKF CLK END
WHILE A DO BEGIN SETF /A END
CHECK Q /Y
TRACE_OFF
